# terrain|distance|layer|id|meshId|lateralOffset|verticalOffset|forwardOffset|scaleX|scaleY|scaleZ|pitchDeg|yawDeg|rollDeg|collisionMode|renderPriority|cullBehind|cullAhead
# event|distance|type|id|payload

